    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地说，**异号两数的和取绝对值较大的加数的符号. 求**",
        "**和的绝对值，要从较大的绝对值中减去较小的绝对值.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 4 加上 $-4$，就得 0（图 84）：",
        "$4+(-4)=0$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地说，**两个相反数的和等于零.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "335",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6 变化了 $-10$. 所得的数位于原点的哪一边？这个数",
        "和原点的距离多大？$6+(-10)$ 的和等于几？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "336",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "10 变化了 $-6$. 所得的数在原点的哪一边？这个数和",
        "原点的距离多大？$10+(-6)$ 的和等于几？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "337",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上午气温变化了 $-4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，下午变化了 $12^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 全天气温变",
        "化了多少度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "338",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作加法：",
        "1) $26+(-6)$；2) $-70+50$；3) $-17+30$；"
      ]
    },
